    "en": {
      "trackName": "Heart Blocks: Puzzle on Watch",
      "description": "The Puzzle Game That Syncs With Your Heartbeat!\nHeart Blocks revolutionizes classic gameplay by connecting to your Apple Watch's heart rate sensor for a truly personalized experience.\n\nPerfect for Apple Watch:\nDesigned specifically for wearable gaming - play during workouts, commutes, or quick breaks. The Digital Crown gives precise block control!\n\n3 Unique Game Modes:\n- Classic: Timeless block-stacking challenge\n- :Heart:Up: : Game gets HARDER as your BPM increases\n- :Heart:Down: : Game gets EASIER as your BPM rises\n\nCompete & Conquer:\nClimb the global leaderboards! Earn the \"Completionist\" achievement by mastering all modes. Challenge friends through Game Center integration.\n\nGame-Changing Features:\n- Apple Watch-optimized controls\n- Real-time heart rate adaptation\n- Global leaderboards via Game Center\n- Quick-play sessions anywhere\n- Colorful heart-shaped blocks\n\nWhy Players Love Heart Blocks:\n\"Finally a game that makes my watch feel alive!“\n\"My heart pounding actually helps me play better!“\n\"Addictive new twist on classic puzzle action“\n\nDownload now and experience gaming that beats with you!\n\nMusic:\nItty Bitty 8 Bit Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\nLicensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 3.0 License\nhttp://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/",
